	(descr "Hybrid THT switch footprint supporting BOTH Cherry MX (5-pin PCB-mount OR 3-pin plate-mount) AND Gateron KS-33 / KS-27 v2.0 Low Profile switches. Solder switches directly, or drop Mill-Max 3305 sockets into the 1.5mm pin holes for hotswap. 1U keycap silkscreen. Center cutout 5.25mm accommodates KS-33 body (MX 4mm center post fits with 0.625mm play, held stable by side alignment posts).")
